# The repository holds the library: its code, its build, its license, and its
# documentation in docs/, one folder per language (ISO 639-1).
# Everything ignored here stays on disk, but has no history and isn't in a clone:
# the reference documents in material/, the tests and the tools, and GNUmakefile,
# which GNU make reads before the Makefile, to add the targets of the tests and the tools.
/material/
/tests/
/tools/
/GNUmakefile
/ideas/

# Of the Markdown files, only the README, in English and Chinese, is kept.
*.md
!/README.md
!/README.zh-CN.md

# Build output, the shared libraries make shared puts in lib/, and anything
# downloaded or built by the setup scripts.
build/
/lib/
third_party/
__pycache__/
.ucoder/

# Written by macOS Finder.
.DS_Store
